  <ym-title|Crown buffer for the selected trace
  probe><label|crown-buffer-for-the-selected-trace-probe>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, trace selected-scale producer.

    <item>Status: draft; elementary finite-volume transfer argument written,
    awaiting independent mathematical/source review.

    <item>Imported Lean revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.

    <item>Manuscript: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/trace-crown-buffer.tex>.
  </itemize-minus>

